ey will hear","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِعَ"},{"ar":"فِيهَا","tr":"fīhā","en":"therein"},{"ar":"لَـٰغِيَةًۭ","tr":"lāghiyatan","en":"vain talk","root":"لغو","lem":"لاغِيَة"}]},{"n":12,"juz":30,"ar":"فِيهَا عَيْنٌ جَارِيَةٌ","en":"Within it is a flowing spring.","w":[{"ar":"فِيهَا","tr":"fīhā","en":"Therein"},{"ar":"عَيْنٌۭ","tr":"ʿaynun","en":"(will be) a spring","root":"عين","lem":"عَيْن"},{"ar":"جَارِيَةٌۭ","tr":"jāriyatun","en":"flowing","root":"جري","lem":"جارِيَة"}]},{"n":13,"juz":30,"ar":"فِيهَا سُرُرٌ مَّرْفُوعَةٌ","en":"Within it are couches raised high","w":[{"ar":"فِيهَا","tr":"fīhā","en":"Therein"},{"ar":"سُرُرٌۭ","tr":"sururun","en":"(will be) thrones","root":"سرر","lem":"سُرُر"},{"ar":"مَّرْفُوعَةٌۭ","tr":"marfūʿatun","en":"raised high","root":"رفع","lem":"مَرْفُوعَة"}]},{"n":14,"juz":30,"ar":"وَأَكْوَابٌ مَّوْضُوعَةٌ","en":"And cups put in place","w":[{"ar":"وَأَكْوَابٌۭ","tr":"wa-akwābun","en":"And cups","root":"كوب","lem":"أَكْواب"},{"ar":"مَّوْضُوعَةٌۭ","tr":"mawḍūʿatun","en":"put in place","root":"وضع","lem":"مَوْضُوعَة"}]},{"n":15,"juz":30,"ar":"وَنَمَارِقُ مَصْفُوفَةٌ","en":"And cushions lined up","w":[{"ar":"وَنَمَارِقُ","tr":"wanamāriqu","en":"And cushions","root":"نمرق","lem":"نَمارِق"},{"ar":"مَصْفُوفَةٌۭ","tr":"maṣfūfatun","en":"lined up","root":"صفف","lem":"مَصْفُوفَة"}]},{"n":16,"juz":30,"ar":"وَزَرَابِىُّ مَبْثُوثَةٌ","en":"And carpets spread around.","w":[{"ar":"وَزَرَابِىُّ","tr":"wazarābiyyu","en":"And carpets","root":"زرب","lem":"زَرابِيّ"},{"ar":"مَبْثُوثَةٌ","tr":"mabthūthatun","en":"spread out","root":"بثث","lem":"مَبْثُوثَة"}]},{"n":17,"juz":30,"ar":"أَفَلَا يَنظُرُونَ إِلَى ٱلْإِبِلِ كَيْفَ خُلِقَتْ","en":"Then do they not look at the camels - how they are created?","w":[{"ar":"أَفَلَا","tr":"afalā","en":"Then do not"},{"ar":"يَنظُرُونَ","tr":"yanẓurūna","en":"they look","root":"نظر","lem":"نَظَرَ"},{"ar":"إِلَى","tr":"ilā","en":"towards"},{"ar":"ٱلْإِبِلِ","tr":"l-ibili","en":"the camels","root":"أبل","lem":"إِبِل"},{"ar":"كَيْفَ","tr":"kayfa","en":"how","root":"كيف","lem":"كَيْف"},{"ar":"خُلِقَتْ","tr":"khuliqat","en":"they are created","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلَقَ"}]},{"n":18,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِلَى ٱلسَّمَآءِ كَيْفَ رُفِعَتْ","en":"And at the sky - how it is raised?","w":[{"ar":"وَإِلَى","tr":"wa-ilā","en":"And towards"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","tr":"l-samāi","en":"the sky","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"كَيْفَ","tr":"kayfa","en":"how","root":"كيف","lem":"كَيْف"},{"ar":"رُفِعَتْ","tr":"rufiʿat","en":"it is raised","root":"رفع","lem":"رَفَعَ"}]},{"n":19,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِلَى ٱلْجِبَالِ كَيْفَ نُصِبَتْ","en":"And at the mountains - how they are erected?","w":[{"ar":"وَإِلَى","tr":"wa-ilā","en":"And towards"},{"ar":"ٱلْجِبَالِ","tr":"l-jibāli","en":"the mountains","root":"جبل","lem":"جَبَل"},{"ar":"كَيْفَ","tr":"kayfa","en":"how","root":"كيف","lem":"كَيْف"},{"ar":"نُصِبَتْ","tr":"nuṣibat","en":"they are fixed","root":"نصب","lem":"نُصِبَتْ"}]},{"n":20,"juz":30,"ar":"وَإِلَى ٱلْأَرْضِ كَيْفَ سُطِحَتْ","en":"And at the earth - how it is spread out?","w":[{"ar":"وَإِلَى","tr":"wa-ilā","en":"And towards"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","tr":"l-arḍi","en":"the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"كَيْفَ","tr":"kayfa","en":"how","root":"كيف","lem":"كَيْف"},{"ar":"سُطِحَتْ","tr":"suṭiḥat","en":"it is spread out","root":"سطح","lem":"سُطِحَتْ"}]},{"n":21,"juz":30,"ar":"فَذَكِّرْ إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مُذَكِّرٌ","en":"So remind, [O Muḥammad]; you are only a reminder.","w":[{"ar":"فَذَكِّرْ","tr":"fadhakkir","en":"So remind","root":"ذكر","lem":"ذُكِّرَ"},{"ar":"إِنَّمَآ","tr":"innamā","en":"only"},{"ar":"أَنتَ","tr":"anta","en":"you"},{"ar":"مُذَكِّرٌۭ","tr":"mudhakkirun","en":"(are) a reminder","root":"ذكر","lem":"مُذَكِّر"}]},{"n":22,"juz":30,"ar":"لَّسْتَ عَلَيْهِم بِمُصَيْطِرٍ","en":"You are not over them a controller.","w":[{"ar":"لَّسْتَ","tr":"lasta","en":"You are not","root":"ليس","lem":"لَيْسَ"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِم","tr":"ʿalayhim","en":"over them"},{"ar":"بِمُصَيْطِرٍ","tr":"bimuṣayṭirin","en":"a controller","root":"سطر","lem":"مُصَيْطِر"}]},{"n":23,"juz":30,"ar":"إِلَّا مَن تَوَلَّىٰ وَكَفَرَ","en":"However, he who turns away and disbelieves","w":[{"ar":"إِلَّا","tr":"illā","en":"But"},{"ar":"مَن","tr":"man","en":"whoever"},{"ar":"تَوَلَّىٰ","tr":"tawallā","en":"turns away","root":"ولي","lem":"تَوَلَّى"},{"ar":"وَكَفَرَ","tr":"wakafara","en":"and disbelieves","root":"كفر","lem":"كَفَرَ"}]},{"n":24,"juz":30,"ar":"فَيُعَذِّبُهُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْعَذَابَ ٱلْأَكْبَرَ","en":"Then Allāh will punish him with the greatest punishment.","w":[{"ar":"فَيُعَذِّبُهُ","tr":"fayuʿadhibuhu","en":"Then will punish him","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذَّبَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابَ","tr":"l-ʿadhāba","en":"(with) the punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَكْبَرَ","tr":"l-akbara","en":"greatest","root":"كبر","lem":"أَكْبَر"}]},{"n":25,"juz":30,"ar":"إِنَّ إِلَيْنَآ إِيَابَهُمْ","en":"Indeed, to Us is their return.","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"إِلَيْنَآ","tr":"ilaynā","en":"to Us"},{"ar":"إِيَابَهُمْ","tr":"iyābahum","en":"(will be) their return","root":"أوب","lem":"إِياب"}]},{"n":26,"juz":30,"ar":"ثُمَّ إِنَّ عَلَيْنَا حِسَابَهُم","en":"Then indeed, upon Us is their account.","w":[{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"indeed"},{"ar":"عَلَيْنَا","tr":"ʿalaynā","en":"upon Us"},{"ar":"حِسَابَهُم","tr":"ḥisābahum","en":"(is) their account","root":"حسب","lem":"حِساب"}]}]}